OL,3,GNEWSAHow Kent may have inspired
OL,4,AOrwell's Animal Farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent is well known for its literary
OL,7,Fconnections.
OL,9,FCharles Dickens, Jane Austen, Ian
OL,10,FFleming, TS Eliot and HG Wells - to
OL,11,Fname just a few - all drew inspiration
OL,12,Ffrom the county in their works.
OL,14,FLesser known is that George Orwell,
OL,15,Fauthor of Animal Farm and 1984, also
OL,16,Fhad connections to the garden of
OL,17,FEngland.
OL,19,FLocal historian Terry Bird said he did
OL,20,Fnot understand why this association had
OL,21,Fslipped under the radar.
